{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move slowly. Look closely. In this world, the silence speaks, and what hides in the stillness is watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this Demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preview the basics of the main game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 1 monster map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the demo with an ending map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a unique gameplay style, with a focus on taking-in your environment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo features: 1 main content map(featuring one demo-unique monster) and 2 more intro/outro maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are no puzzles, jump scares, or goals.. there's only you... and your camera. Only the most patient are able to hunt down the ethereal beings of the other world(s).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658140?t=1746397239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658140?t=1746397239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658140/d8e857acc16da71dc093dcbf141888ce0765219d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746397239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658140/d8e857acc16da71dc093dcbf141888ce0765219d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746397239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move slowly. Look closely. In this world, the silence speaks, and what hides in the stillness is watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In t